# AI Memory & Vision (Core)

Before writing code, read project context documents.

## Required Reading

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `PROJECT_GOALS.md` | Why the app exists, story, main goals — ensure feature aligns with vision |
| `MEMORY_BANK.md` | Latest changes, critical fixes, added features |

## Update Obligation

After every significant milestone, AI agents **must** update `MEMORY_BANK.md`:

- Add a dated summary at the **top** of the file
- Include what changed and why

```markdown
## 2026-06-29 — Added EditCategory screen
- Domain: GetCategoryUseCase + UpdateCategoryUseCase
- UI: MVI screen with Route wired in NavigationRoot
```

Do not start coding without reading both files when they exist in the repo.
